    },
    "“Must hold for” suppresses flapping — a metric bouncing across the threshold resets the timer instead of firing. “Cooldown” is the minimum gap between two firings of this rule once it has fired. They are independent: satisfying one does not substitute for the other." : {

    },
    "\"Require confirmation\" shows a native dialog in Sentry before the action runs, every time — the agent's call is paused until you allow or deny it." : {

