    "Change these in the Advanced pane. The cap applies across every rule combined: once it's reached, further firings are still recorded in History and marked Suppressed rather than silently dropped. Do Not Disturb is a full mute instead of a cap — while it's on, nothing fires and nothing is recorded, the same as a rule's own quiet hours." : {

